<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21431" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γᾰλᾰθηνός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sucking, young, tender</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεβροί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.336
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Anacr.
				51
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simon.
					52
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					18.41
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				6.2.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαλαθηνά</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόβατα</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.183
			</span></i>; (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοιρία</span>) opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέλεια</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				44
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aff.</u>
				43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1015.32
			</span></i> (Halic., written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαλαθεινός</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; ἀρνῶν καὶ χοίρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Crates Com.
					1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὗς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					28
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				603b25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρέφη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Clearch.
					17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				24.31
			</span></i>. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάλα, θῆσθαι</span>.)</div>
